  "notable_quotes": [
    "Despite weak direct amine participation, cooperative CO2–CO2 interactions in 1 increase overall binding by more than 7 kJ mol−1.",
    "In 1, corrugated ZnAtz layers place adjacent Atz groups antiparallel, so amines do not protrude into pores and their role in CO2 binding is diminished.",
    "The 32 kJ mol−1 CO2 adsorption enthalpy of 1 is above most non-amine MOFs but well below the 40.8 kJ mol−1 reported for MOF 2."
